# TIN TROOP 1-A, played start to finish with plain button presses (recorded
# once from a route plan, cheat plan_go). Two lances make a ladder up the
# bookshelf, a Pop opens the toy blocks under the wardrobe, a stone dropped
# in the air crushes the spikes and makes a step, a stone at the toy box
# makes another, and the last soldier rides his chute onto the high shelf.
game tintroop
wait 5
press A
wait 5
press A
